<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <title>Privacy Policy · Slow Down 4 Sam</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Privacy policy for Slow Down 4 Sam, a Michigan nonprofit honoring Sam Gross through motorcycle safety and youth programs.">
    <meta property="og:title" content="Privacy Policy · Slow Down 4 Sam" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="Privacy policy for Slow Down 4 Sam, a Michigan nonprofit honoring Sam Gross through motorcycle safety and youth programs." />
    <%- include('_global_meta'); %>
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include('_header'); %>
    <main id="main">
      <section class="page-hero">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="eyebrow">Legal</div>
          <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
          <p>Your information is valuable and we are pleased to provide information regarding your privacy.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head">
            <div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--green-2)">What we collect</div>
            <h2>Kinds of personal information we collect and store</h2>
            <p>As we use third parties for our login methods, we collect information provided by these services. Information we collect is:</p>
          </div>
          <div class="list">
            <div class="list-item">
              <h3>Account IDs</h3>
              <p class="muted">Identifiers tied to your login account.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="list-item">
              <h3>Emails</h3>
              <p class="muted">The email address supplied by you or a login service.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="list-item">
              <h3>Creation of your account</h3>
              <p class="muted">When the account was created.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="list-item">
              <h3>Account profile photo / avatar</h3>
              <p class="muted">The image associated with your account.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="list-item">
              <h3>Internet Protocol (IP)</h3>
              <p class="muted">The IP address used to reach our site.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="list-item">
              <h3>Payment information</h3>
              <p class="muted">For PayPal, we collect your account handle/email. For Stripe transactions we collect the last 4 digits of your card, along with transaction IDs for both services.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>Possible login services we can enable are Discord, GitHub, Google, and Twitter. These services give basic information supplied by their API. Their Terms of Service and privacy policies can be viewed on their respective platforms.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section alt">
        <div class="container grid grid-2">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--green-2)">Collection</div>
            <h2>How we collect your information</h2>
            <p>Once you log in and create an account your information from there is collected and stored in our secure database. This information includes the kinds of personal information listed above. Payment information is only collected when a purchase has been made on our website.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--green-2)">Use</div>
            <h2>How we use your information</h2>
            <p>We actively use your information on your account page along with administrational logs which include payment history, audit logs, and receipts.</p>
            <p>We also use your information with our third parties which are able to request user information access.</p>
            <p>Additionally, we also collect data to use in advertising on various advertisement platforms. The shared information with advertising is broad and is not figures for individual user accounts. The data is collected and used as a sum total between all users to gather statistics for our website.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="container card dark">
          <div class="eyebrow">Slow Down 4 Sam</div>
          <h2>A Michigan non-profit in honor of Sam Gross.</h2>
          <p>Teaching motorcycle safety to young adults. Website: https://slowdown4sam.org · Email: contact@slowdown4sam.org · Location: Michigan, United States.</p>
          <div class="actions">
            <a class="btn btn-light" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
            <a class="btn btn-light" href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <%- include('_footer'); %>
  </body>
</html>
